  "description": "Next.js 管理后台（用户/渠道/模型/计费/链路运营面）——BFF 会话 + api-client 消费 admin-api，零能力包直依赖",
  "license": "MIT",
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "bun x next dev -p 3002",
